 "title": "County Treasurer | Lancaster County, NE",
 "text": "County Treasurer | Lancaster County, NE\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\n-->\nDepartments\nBusiness\nTourism\nCounty Services\nHow Do I...\nSearch\nHome\nDepartments\nA through C\nCounty Treasurer\nCounty Treasurer\nWelcome to the Lancaster County Treasurer\nPursuant to Nebraska State Statutes, the County Treasurer collects property taxes to be distributed to schools, fire districts, cities, villages, etc. In conjunction with the State Department of Motor Vehicles we also oversee over 300,000 motor vehicle registrations and titles.\nOur offices are open between the hours of 7:30am-4:30pm, Monday through Friday. Customers are encouraged to use online services to pay property taxes as well as for vehicle registration renewals.\nAppointments\nYou can schedule appointments with the Treasurer's office at our 625 N 46th St. location for your Motor Vehicle title/registration services.\nBook Appointment\nServices\nClick a tab in the table below for a quick reference to our most frequently used services.\nProperty Tax\nMotor Vehicle\nProperty Tax\nOnline: | Pay or View\n|\nPhone: | 402-441-7425\n|\nMail: | Lancaster County Treasurer\n555 S 10th St. Room 102\nLincoln, NE 68508\n|\nDrop Box: | 555 S 10th St. Room 102\nLincoln, NE 68508\nBox 1 - West side of City/County Building (outside - near 9th St.).\nBox 2 - Inside the Treasurer office lobby (Room 102)\n625 N 46th St.\nLincoln, NE 68503\nBox 1 - East side of front entrance (outside - after hours)\nBox 2 - Inside (In Lobby)\n|\nWalk-in: | 555 S 10th St. Room 102\nLincoln, NE 68508\nHours:\nMonday - Friday 7:30am - 4:30pm\n|\nMotor Vehicle\nAppointment: | Book an Appointment\n|\nOnline: | Online Renewal\n|\nPhone: | 402-441-7497\n|\nMail: | Lancaster County Treasurer\nMotor Vehicles Division\n625 N 46th St.\nLincoln, NE 68503\n|\nDrop Box: | 625 N 46th St. Lincoln, NE 68503\nBox 1 - East side of front entrance (outside - after hours) Box 2 - Inside (In Lobby) |\nWalk-in: | 625 N 46th St. Lincoln, NE 68503\nHours:\nMonday - Friday 7:30am - 4:30pm |\nNews\nMotor Vehicle Wheel Tax Late Fee\nRead on...\nTax Payments and Recent USPS Postmark Changes\nRead on...\nDisabled Veteran Motor Vehicle Tax & Fee Exemption\nRead on...\n2025 Property Taxes\nRead on...\n/CivicAlerts.aspx\nContact Us\nRachel M. Garver\nCounty Treasurer\nEmail County Treasurer\nPhysical Address\nView Map\n555 S 10th St.\nRm #102\nLincoln , NE 68508\n555 S 10th St. Rm #102 Lincoln NE 68508\nDirections\nPhone: 402-441-7425\nFax: 402-441-8841\nDirectory\nMotor Vehicles\nEmail Motor Vehicles\nPhysical Address\nView Map\n625 N 46th St.\nLincoln , NE 68503\n625 N 46th St. Lincoln NE 68503\nDirections\nPhone: 402-441-7497\nFax: 402-441-6484\nDirectory\nLocations and Hours\nMotor Vehicles\nFAQs\nForms & Fees\nRegistration / Plates Renewal\nRenew By Phone\nRenew Online\nRequest for Taxes & Fees Paid\nRequest a Vehicle Quote\nSpecialty Plates\nDriver's License\nFAQ's\nReal Estate\nProperty Taxes\nPay or View Property Tax\nElectronic Bill Pay\nImportant Dates\nLevy Rates\nMailing Address Change Request\nMulti-Parcel Payment Program (PDF)\nUnderstanding Your Tax Bill (PDF)\nTax Sale Information\nDelinquent Tax Listing\nFAQs\nTransparency\nApproved Banks for Deposits\nLancaster County and Treasurer's Office Budget\nProperty Tax Distributed\nRegistration Fees and Taxes Information\nTreasurer Semi-Annual Reports\nWheel Tax Distribution Information\nUnclaimed Property\nAbout Us\nMission & Goals\nPress Releases\nProfessional Affiliation\nStaff\nJobs\nOnline\nPayments\nAssessor\nBudget\nCorrections\nAgendas &\nMinutes\nMarriage Licenses\nTreasurer\nCourts\nReport Road\nIssues\n-->\nLANCASTER COUNTY WEATHER\nContact Us\n555 S 10th Street\nLincoln, NE 68508\nStaff Directory\nHELPFUL LINKS\nContact Us\nAccessibility\nCopyright Notices\nSite Map\nWork for Lancaster County\nNewsroom\nHome\nLancaster County Bid & Business Opportunities\n/